ircuit.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":0,"text":"At exactly 10 o'clock the 14 group one cars were sent away. Amid the din of the engines Caracciola stormed immediately into the lead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":23},{"lap":1,"text":"Finally after 15m27.2s Caracciola blasted past the pits. Another 14.2 seconds later von Morgen came past with Nuvolari a further 14 seconds behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":23},{"lap":2,"text":"Caracciola's white Mercedes-Benz SSK led Morgen's white Bugatti by 13.8 seconds pursued by Nuvolari's red Alfa Romeo another 9.2 seconds behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":23},{"lap":2,"text":"Borzacchini pits for new spark plugs and drops to eleventh.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":3,"text":"On lap three Ve\u0159mi\u0159ovsk\u00fd had to retire his slow Tatra with a broken gearbox.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":27},{"lap":3,"text":"Von Morgen established a new lap record of 15m01.1s and was only 1.1 seconds behind the Mercedes as they passed the grandstand.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":3,"text":"Dr. Bittmann brought his Bugatti into the pits to change spark plugs. He lost so much time that he fell back to last place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":22},{"lap":4,"text":"On lap four, Michel Dor\u00e9 crashed his Bugatti after leading the small class in superior style.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":26},{"lap":4,"text":"Longueville crashed his Bugatti, when his car did not make it through the very fast left hand bend near km 24. However, the Frenchman escaped without injuries.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":25},{"lap":5,"text":"Von Morgen finally found a way past the inflexible Caracciola. After five laps the Bugatti was 10.4 seconds ahead of the Mercedes.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":5,"text":"Nuvolari is out: cracked crank case and clutch problems, car and driver covered in oil.","q":false,"c":24},{"lap":7,"text":"at the end of lap seven, Morgen lost five minutes when he stopped at his depot for new wheels and gasoline. He told his crew that his engine no longer worked properly.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":8,"text":"Caracciola takes the lead.","q":false,"c":23},{"lap":8,"text":"Caracciola's Mercedes stops out on the circuit and he gives up.","q":false,"c":23},{"lap":8,"text":"After eight laps Morgen was leading Borzacchini by eight minutes, followed by Leiningen, Burggaller, Bondy, Knapp, Tacheci, Kubi\u010dek, Bittmann, and \"H\u00fdta\".","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":9,"text":"At the completion of the ninth lap, Morgen was leading Leiningen by over two minutes followed by Borzacchini, now four minutes behind the leader.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":9,"text":"Leiningen pits for wheels and fuel but stays sitting on the pit counter; Borzacchini stops to fill up with water.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":10,"text":"He jumped out of his car straight into Leiningen's waiting Bugatti and rushed away. Morgen had left his leading car for his friend, Prince zu Leiningen, who chased right after him.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":11,"text":"Nuvolari takes over Borzacchini's Alfa Romeo, six minutes behind Leiningen.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":12,"text":"At the end of the twelfth lap, Knapp retired his 3.3-liter Walter with a broken oil line while in fifth place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":19},{"lap":14,"text":"On lap 14, Nuvolari was able to maintain his speed but had to stop again for water. Morgen made a good lap in 15m08s which enabled him to make up another minute.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":15,"text":"Tacheci, already one lap behind the leader, retired his Imp\u00e9ria with a defective cooling fan.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":16,"text":"On the 16th and second to last lap, Leiningen finally gave up when the worn-out Bugatti broke down.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":16,"text":"Von Morgen, driving at his fastest possible pace, caught up with Burgaller and passed him to take second place. After 16 laps Nuvolari led von Morgen by 4m11.3s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":17,"text":"Since the Alfa's radiator was boiling, Nuvolari drove with an open hood.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":17,"text":"Nuvolari's Alfa breaks down near km 20, out of water; three Bugattis pass him.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":17,"text":"Von Morgen crossed the finish line in first place, after almost five hours of racing. He had done the last lap in 15m16.9s, a truly magnificent drive.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":17,"text":"Burggaller finished second with a gap of 2m56.2s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":17,"text":"Hardegg wins Group B and is third overall; Nuvolari crawls in fourth, 32 minutes down.","q":false,"c":5}]}